 "wingChainReason": "2026-09-27 workerB: the rigid wing bones never beat (Move wingSwing ~0.6 deg); silhouetteRefine faked it by rolling the whole body (toy ratio 57-81x) and the corrective bake blew up (morph 0.76). Articulated chain per ext/wing_chain.py as the griffins. Keys read off the DEF plates (stormbird/ayssid/halcyon share one DEF animation): Move is one flap per 10-frame clip, up on frames 9-0-1, down on 4-6, wing edge-on (folded) on the upstroke 7-8 -> flap sin 50 phase 90, fold/droop on the rising half; MoveStart/End spread and fold over 2 frames; AttackFront spreads wide on 2-6; Death opens then collapses; Defence (wings cloaked forward) is left to the fit.",
